# Claude Code working protocol and the local record (D001/D002, adopted 2026-09-21 from la3se):
# local-only on this machine, never pushed — the agent definitions, the hook, the derived
# CLAUDE.md block, the implog + session handovers, the scratch workspace and the spawn-gate log.
# Root-anchored so the subprojects' own docs/ and .vscode/ stay tracked.
# The protocol pack and the record gate live under logs/ (ignored by the `logs/` rule above).
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/
/analysis-scratch/
/.vscode/
*.log

# Jupyter checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Release hygiene (2026-09-22): dump/ held the two reference clones vendored into veritas/
# (with attribution; deleted after vendoring — the rule guards a re-clone); per-tool virtual
# environments and caches.
/dump/
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
